  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2022 SUPPORT TO THE EDUCATION SECTOR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FASE is a multi-donor pooled fund jointly managed by the Cooperating Partner signatories to the FASE MoU with MINEDH. It finances the implementation of the Government&#x2019;s Education Sector Plan (ESP) 2020 &#x2013; 2029. FASE is an integral part of the education system in Mozambique, financing priorities within the Education Sector Plan (ESP) 2020-2029 and annual actions selected within the ESP&#x2019;s Annual Activity Plan (PdA). In 2022 The focus of MINEDH is on continuing to improve the functioning of schools for the better performance of students. The ESP 2020-2029 has three main objectives:A.Ensure inclusion and equity in access, participation and retention.B.Ensure the quality of learning.C.Ensure transparent, participatory, efficient and effective governance.</narrative>
  </description>
